text.section:
Each public institution of higher education shall release an annual report regarding foundations associated with the institution setting forth foundation expenses. The annual report shall include:

The total annual expenditures by each foundation;


The percentage of expenditures used for scholarships or financial aid by each foundation;


The percentage of expenditures used for faculty compensation by each foundation;


The percentage of expenditures used for program costs by each foundation;


The percentage of expenditures used for equipment and technology by each foundation;


The percentage of expenditures used for administrative support by each foundation; and


The percentage of expenditures used for executive compensation by each foundation.
